{"v":[{"a":["وَٱلنَّجۡمِ","إِذَا","هَوَىٰ"],"t":"By the star as it goes down","l":"Wa An-Najmi 'Idha Hawa","w":[["wal-najmi","By the star"],["idhā","when"],["hawā","it goes down"]]},{"a":["مَا","ضَلَّ","صَاحِبُكُمۡ","وَمَا","غَوَىٰ"],"t":"Your friend has not gone astray, nor has he erred","l":"Ma Đalla Sahibukum Wa Ma Ghawa","w":[["mā","Not"],["ḍalla","has strayed"],["ṣāḥibukum","your companion"],["wamā","and not"],["ghawā","has he erred"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","يَنطِقُ","عَنِ","ٱلۡهَوَىٰٓ"],"t":"Nor does he speak out of desire","l":"Wa Ma Yantiqu `Ani Al-Hawa","w":[["wamā","And not"],["yanṭiqu","he speaks"],["ʿani","from"],["l-hawā","the desire"]]},{"a":["إِنۡ","هُوَ","إِلَّا","وَحۡيٞ","يُوحَىٰ"],"t":"It is but a revelation revealed","l":"In Huwa 'Illa Wahyun Yuha","w":[["in","Not"],["huwa","it"],["illā","(is) except"],["waḥyun","a revelation"],["yūḥā","revealed"]]},{"a":["عَلَّمَهُۥ","شَدِيدُ","ٱلۡقُوَىٰ"],"t":"Taught to him by the Extremely Powerful","l":"Allamahu Shadidu Al-Quwa","w":[["ʿallamahu","Has taught him"],["shadīdu","the (one) mighty"],["l-quwā","(in) power"]]},{"a":["ذُو","مِرَّةٖ","فَٱسۡتَوَىٰ"],"t":"The one of vigor. He settled","l":"Dhu Mirratin Fastawa","w":[["dhū","Possessor of soundness"],["mirratin","Possessor of soundness"],["fa-is'tawā","And he rose"]]},{"a":["وَهُوَ","بِٱلۡأُفُقِ","ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ"],"t":"While he was at the highest horizon","l":"Wa Huwa Bil-'Ufuqi Al-'A`la","w":[["wahuwa","While he"],["bil-ufuqi","(was) in the horizon "],["l-aʿlā","the highest"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","دَنَا","فَتَدَلَّىٰ"],"t":"Then he came near, and hovered around","l":"Thumma Dana Fatadalla","w":[["thumma","Then"],["danā","he approached"],["fatadallā","and came down"]]},{"a":["فَكَانَ","قَابَ","قَوۡسَيۡنِ","أَوۡ","أَدۡنَىٰ"],"t":"He was within two bows’ length, or closer","l":"Fakana Qaba Qawsayni 'Aw 'Adna","w":[["fakāna","And was"],["qāba","(at) a distance"],["qawsayni","(of) two bow-(lengths)"],["aw","or"],["adnā","nearer"]]},{"a":["فَأَوۡحَىٰٓ","إِلَىٰ","عَبۡدِهِۦ","مَآ","أَوۡحَىٰ"],"t":"Then He revealed to His servant what He revealed","l":"Fa'awha 'Ila `Abdihi Ma 'Awha","w":[["fa-awḥā","So he revealed"],["ilā","to"],["ʿabdihi","His slave"],["mā","what"],["awḥā","he revealed"]]},{"a":["مَا","كَذَبَ","ٱلۡفُؤَادُ","مَا","رَأَىٰٓ"],"t":"The heart did not lie about what it saw","l":"Ma Kadhaba Al-Fu'uadu Ma Ra'a","w":[["mā","Not"],["kadhaba","lied"],["l-fuādu","the heart"],["mā","what"],["raā","it saw"]]},{"a":["أَفَتُمَٰرُونَهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","يَرَىٰ"],"t":"Will you dispute with him concerning what he saw","l":"Afatumarunahu `Ala Ma Yara","w":[["afatumārūnahu","Then will you dispute with him"],["ʿalā","about"],["mā","what"],["yarā","he saw"]]},{"a":["وَلَقَدۡ","رَءَاهُ","نَزۡلَةً","أُخۡرَىٰ"],"t":"He saw him on another descent","l":"Wa Laqad Ra'ahu Nazlatan 'Ukhra","w":[["walaqad","And certainly"],["raāhu","he saw him"],["nazlatan","(in) descent"],["ukh'rā","another"]]},{"a":["عِندَ","سِدۡرَةِ","ٱلۡمُنتَهَىٰ"],"t":"At the Lotus Tree of the Extremity","l":"Inda Sidrati Al-Muntaha","w":[["ʿinda","Near"],["sid'rati","(the) Lote Tree"],["l-muntahā","(of) the utmost boundary"]]},{"a":["عِندَهَا","جَنَّةُ","ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰٓ"],"t":"Near which is the Garden of Repose","l":"Indaha Jannatu Al-Ma'wa","w":[["ʿindahā","Near it"],["jannatu","(is the) Garden"],["l-mawā","(of) Abode"]]},{"a":["إِذۡ","يَغۡشَى","ٱلسِّدۡرَةَ","مَا","يَغۡشَىٰ"],"t":"As there covered the Lotus Tree what covered it","l":"Idh Yaghsha As-Sidrata Ma Yaghsha","w":[["idh","When"],["yaghshā","covered"],["l-sid'rata","the Lote Tree"],["mā","what"],["yaghshā","covers"]]},{"a":["مَا","زَاغَ","ٱلۡبَصَرُ","وَمَا","طَغَىٰ"],"t":"The sight did not waver, nor did it exceed","l":"Ma Zagha Al-Basaru Wa Ma Tagha","w":[["mā","Not"],["zāgha","swerved"],["l-baṣaru","the sight"],["wamā","and not"],["ṭaghā","it transgressed"]]},{"a":["لَقَدۡ","رَأَىٰ","مِنۡ","ءَايَٰتِ","رَبِّهِ","ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰٓ"],"t":"He saw some of the Great Signs of his Lord","l":"Laqad Ra'a Min 'Ayati Rabbihi Al-Kubra","w":[["laqad","Certainly"],["raā","he saw"],["min","of"],["āyāti","(the) Signs"],["rabbihi","(of) his Lord"],["l-kub'rā","the Greatest"]]},{"a":["أَفَرَءَيۡتُمُ","ٱللَّـٰتَ","وَٱلۡعُزَّىٰ"],"t":"Have you considered al-Lat and al-Uzza","l":"Afara'aytumu Al-Lata Wa Al-`Uzza","w":[["afara-aytumu","So have you seen"],["l-lāta","the Lat"],["wal-ʿuzā","and the Uzza"]]},{"a":["وَمَنَوٰةَ","ٱلثَّالِثَةَ","ٱلۡأُخۡرَىٰٓ"],"t":"And Manat, the third one, the other","l":"Wa Manaata Ath-Thalithata Al-'Ukhra","w":[["wamanata","And Manat"],["l-thālithata","the third"],["l-ukh'rā","the other"]]},{"a":["أَلَكُمُ","ٱلذَّكَرُ","وَلَهُ","ٱلۡأُنثَىٰ"],"t":"Are you to have the males, and He the females","l":"Alakumu Adh-Dhakaru Wa Lahu Al-'Untha","w":[["alakumu","Is for you"],["l-dhakaru","the male"],["walahu","and for Him"],["l-unthā","the female"]]},{"a":["تِلۡكَ","إِذٗا","قِسۡمَةٞ","ضِيزَىٰٓ"],"t":"What a bizarre distribution","l":"Tilka 'Idhaan Qismatun Điza","w":[["til'ka","This"],["idhan","then"],["qis'matun","(is) a division"],["ḍīzā","unfair"]]},{"a":["إِنۡ","هِيَ","إِلَّآ","أَسۡمَآءٞ","سَمَّيۡتُمُوهَآ","أَنتُمۡ","وَءَابَآؤُكُم","مَّآ","أَنزَلَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِهَا","مِن","سُلۡطَٰنٍۚ","إِن","يَتَّبِعُونَ","إِلَّا","ٱلظَّنَّ","وَمَا","تَهۡوَى","ٱلۡأَنفُسُۖ","وَلَقَدۡ","جَآءَهُم","مِّن","رَّبِّهِمُ","ٱلۡهُدَىٰٓ"],"t":"These are nothing but names, which you have devised, you and your ancestors, for which God sent down no authority. They follow nothing but assumptions, and what the ego desires, even though guidance has come to them from their Lord","l":"In Hiya 'Illa 'Asma'un Sammaytumuha 'Antum Wa 'Aba'uukum Ma 'Anzala Allahu Biha Min Sultanin 'In Yattabi`una 'Illa Az-Zanna Wa Ma Tahwa Al-'Anfusu Wa Laqad Ja'ahum Min Rabbihimu Al-Huda","w":[["in","Not"],["hiya","they"],["illā","(are) except"],["asmāon","names"],["sammaytumūhā","you have named them"],["antum","you"],["waābāukum","and your forefathers"],["mā","not"],["anzala","has Allah sent down"],["l-lahu","has Allah sent down"],["bihā","for it"],["min","any"],["sul'ṭānin","authority"],["in","Not"],["yattabiʿūna","they follow"],["illā","except"],["l-ẓana","assumption"],["wamā","and what"],["tahwā","desire"],["l-anfusu","the(ir) souls"],["walaqad","And certainly"],["jāahum","has come to them"],["min","from"],["rabbihimu","their Lord"],["l-hudā","the guidance"]]},{"a":["أَمۡ","لِلۡإِنسَٰنِ","مَا","تَمَنَّىٰ"],"t":"Or is the human being to have whatever he desires","l":"Am Lil'insani Ma Tamanna","w":[["am","Or"],["lil'insāni","(is) for man"],["mā","what"],["tamannā","he wishes"]]},{"a":["فَلِلَّهِ","ٱلۡأٓخِرَةُ","وَٱلۡأُولَىٰ"],"t":"To God belong the Last and the First","l":"Falillahi Al-'Akhiratu Wa Al-'Ula","w":[["falillahi","But for Allah"],["l-ākhiratu","(is) the last"],["wal-ūlā","and the first"]]},{"a":["۞وَكَم","مِّن","مَّلَكٖ","فِي","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","لَا","تُغۡنِي","شَفَٰعَتُهُمۡ","شَيۡـًٔا","إِلَّا","مِنۢ","بَعۡدِ","أَن","يَأۡذَنَ","ٱللَّهُ","لِمَن","يَشَآءُ","وَيَرۡضَىٰٓ"],"t":"How many an angel is there in the heavens whose intercession avails nothing, except after God gives permission to whomever He wills, and approves","l":"Wa Kam Min Malakin Fi As-Samawati La Tughni Shafa`atuhum Shay'aan 'Illa Min Ba`di 'An Ya'dhana Allahu Liman Yasha'u Wa Yarđa","w":[["wakam","And how many"],["min","of"],["malakin","(the) Angels"],["fī","in"],["l-samāwāti","the heavens"],["lā","not"],["tugh'nī","will avail"],["shafāʿatuhum","their intercession"],["shayan","anything"],["illā","except"],["min","after"],["baʿdi","after"],["an","[that]"],["yadhana","Allah has given permission"],["l-lahu","Allah has given permission"],["liman","for whom"],["yashāu","He wills"],["wayarḍā","and approves"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤۡمِنُونَ","بِٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","لَيُسَمُّونَ","ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","تَسۡمِيَةَ","ٱلۡأُنثَىٰ"],"t":"Those who do not believe in the Hereafter give the angels the names of females","l":"Inna Al-Ladhina La Yu'uminuna Bil-'Akhirati Layusammuna Al-Mala'ikata Tasmiyata Al-'Untha","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["alladhīna","those who"],["lā","(do) not"],["yu'minūna","believe"],["bil-ākhirati","in the Hereafter"],["layusammūna","surely they name"],["l-malāikata","the Angels"],["tasmiyata","name(s)"],["l-unthā","(of) female"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","لَهُم","بِهِۦ","مِنۡ","عِلۡمٍۖ","إِن","يَتَّبِعُونَ","إِلَّا","ٱلظَّنَّۖ","وَإِنَّ","ٱلظَّنَّ","لَا","يُغۡنِي","مِنَ","ٱلۡحَقِّ","شَيۡـٔٗا"],"t":"They have no knowledge of that. They only follow assumptions, and assumptions are no substitute for the truth","l":"Wa Ma Lahum Bihi Min `Ilmin 'In Yattabi`una 'Illa Az-Zanna Wa 'Inna Az-Zanna La Yughni Mina Al-Haqqi Shay'aan","w":[["wamā","And not"],["lahum","for them"],["bihi","about it"],["min","any"],["ʿil'min","knowledge"],["in","Not"],["yattabiʿūna","they follow"],["illā","but"],["l-ẓana","assumption"],["wa-inna","And indeed"],["l-ẓana","the assumption"],["lā","(does) not"],["yugh'nī","avail"],["mina","against"],["l-ḥaqi","the truth"],["shayan","anything"]]},{"a":["فَأَعۡرِضۡ","عَن","مَّن","تَوَلَّىٰ","عَن","ذِكۡرِنَا","وَلَمۡ","يُرِدۡ","إِلَّا","ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنۡيَا"],"t":"So avoid him who has turned away from Our remembrance, and desires nothing but the present life","l":"Fa'a`riđ `An Man Tawalla `An Dhikrina Wa Lam Yurid 'Illa Al-Hayaata Ad-Dunya","w":[["fa-aʿriḍ","So turn away"],["ʿan","from"],["man","(him) who"],["tawallā","turns away"],["ʿan","from"],["dhik'rinā","Our Reminder"],["walam","and not"],["yurid","he desires"],["illā","except"],["l-ḥayata","the life"],["l-dun'yā","(of) the world"]]},{"a":["ذَٰلِكَ","مَبۡلَغُهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلۡعِلۡمِۚ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","هُوَ","أَعۡلَمُ","بِمَن","ضَلَّ","عَن","سَبِيلِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","أَعۡلَمُ","بِمَنِ","ٱهۡتَدَىٰ"],"t":"That is the extent of their knowledge. Your Lord knows best who has strayed from His path, and He knows best who has accepted guidance","l":"Dhalika Mablaghuhum Mina Al-`Ilmi 'Inna Rabbaka Huwa 'A`lamu Biman Đalla `An Sabilihi Wa Huwa 'A`lamu Bimani Ahtada","w":[["dhālika","That"],["mablaghuhum","(is) their sum"],["mina","of"],["l-ʿil'mi","knowledge"],["inna","Indeed"],["rabbaka","your Lord"],["huwa","(is) He (Who)"],["aʿlamu","knows best"],["biman","(he) who"],["ḍalla","strays"],["ʿan","from"],["sabīlihi","His Path"],["wahuwa","and He"],["aʿlamu","knows best"],["bimani","(he) who"],["ih'tadā","is guided"]]},{"a":["وَلِلَّهِ","مَا","فِي","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَمَا","فِي","ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","لِيَجۡزِيَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَسَـٰٓـُٔواْ","بِمَا","عَمِلُواْ","وَيَجۡزِيَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَحۡسَنُواْ","بِٱلۡحُسۡنَى"],"t":"To God belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on earth. He will repay those who do evil according to their deeds, and recompense those who do good with the best","l":"Wa Lillahi Ma Fi As-Samawati Wa Ma Fi Al-'Arđi Liyajziya Al-Ladhina 'Asa'u Bima `Amilu Wa Yajziya Al-Ladhina 'Ahsanu Bil-Husna","w":[["walillahi","And for Allah"],["mā","(is) whatever"],["fī","(is) in"],["l-samāwāti","the heavens"],["wamā","and whatever"],["fī","(is) in"],["l-arḍi","the earth"],["liyajziya","that He may recompense"],["alladhīna","those who"],["asāū","do evil"],["bimā","with what"],["ʿamilū","they have done"],["wayajziya","and recompense"],["alladhīna","those who"],["aḥsanū","do good"],["bil-ḥus'nā","with the best"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَجۡتَنِبُونَ","كَبَـٰٓئِرَ","ٱلۡإِثۡمِ","وَٱلۡفَوَٰحِشَ","إِلَّا","ٱللَّمَمَۚ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","وَٰسِعُ","ٱلۡمَغۡفِرَةِۚ","هُوَ","أَعۡلَمُ","بِكُمۡ","إِذۡ","أَنشَأَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","وَإِذۡ","أَنتُمۡ","أَجِنَّةٞ","فِي","بُطُونِ","أُمَّهَٰتِكُمۡۖ","فَلَا","تُزَكُّوٓاْ","أَنفُسَكُمۡۖ","هُوَ","أَعۡلَمُ","بِمَنِ","ٱتَّقَىٰٓ"],"t":"Those who avoid gross sins and indecencies—except for minor lapses—your Lord is of Vast Forgiveness. He knows you well, ever since He created you from the earth, and ever since you were embryos in your mothers’ wombs. So do not acclaim your own virtue; He is fully aware of the righteous","l":"Al-Ladhina Yajtanibuna Kaba'ira Al-'Ithmi Wa Al-Fawahisha 'Illa Al-Lamama 'Inna Rabbaka Wasi`u Al-Maghfirati Huwa 'A`lamu Bikum 'Idh 'Ansh